^YTT(601.95,1,1,1333,0)=" 1. Over the past 2 weeks, how often have you had thoughts that you would be better off dead or of hurting yourself in some way?|   <*Answer_8004*>|\r\n  2. Over the past month, have you wished you were dead or wished you could go to sleep "
