^YTT(601.95,18,1,469,0)="gulation: Development, factor structure, and initial validation of the Difficulties in Emotion Regulation Scale. Journal of Psychopathology and Behavioral Assessment, 26, 41-54."",""requireSignature"":false,""requiresLicense"":""N"",""scoringRevisi"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,470,0)="on"":1,""scoringRoutine"":""YTSDERS"",""scoringTag"":null,""submitNational"":true,""targetPopulation"":null,""version"":""3\/1\/2013"",""wasOperational"":true},""report"":{""id"":135,""instrument"":209,""template"":"".|  .|  Difficulties in Emotion Regulation Scale("
^YTT(601.95,18,1,471,0)="DERS)||  Date Given: <.Date_Given.>|  Clinician: <.Staff_Ordered_By.>|  Location: <.Location.>|  |  Veteran: <.Patient_Name_Last_First.>|  SSN:\r\n<.Patient_SSN.>|  DOB: <.Patient_Date_Of_Birth.> (<.Patient_Age.>)|  Gender: <.Patient_Gender"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,472,0)=".>|  |  |  <.DLL_String.>|  |   |\r\n \r\nDERS TOTAL SCORE = <-TOTAL->|\r\nSUBSCALE SCORES: |\r\n   Non-acceptance of emotional responses(NONACCEPT) = <-NONACCEPT->|\r\n   Difficulties engaging in goal-directed behavior(GOALS) = <-GOALS->|\"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,473,0)="r\n   Impulse control difficulties(IMPULSE) = <-IMPULSE->|\r\n   Limited access to emotion regulation strategies(STRATEGIES) = <-STRATEGIES->|\r\n   Lack of emotional awareness (AWARENESS) = <-AWARENESS->|\r\n   Lack of emotional clarity(CL"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,474,0)="ARITY) = <-CLARITY->|\r\nHigher scores suggest greater problems with emotion regulation.\r\n|\r\n|\r\nQuestions and Answers|\r\n  1. I am clear about my feelings.|      <*Answer_7023*>|\r\n  2. I pay attention to how I feel.|      <*Answer_"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,475,0)="7024*>|\r\n  3. I experience my emotions as overwhelming and out of control.|      <*Answer_7025*>|\r\n  4. I have no idea how I am feeling.|      <*Answer_7026*>|\r\n  5. I have difficulty making sense out of my feelings.|      <*Answer_70"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,476,0)="27*>|\r\n  6. I am attentive to my feelings.|      <*Answer_7028*>|\r\n  7. I know exactly how I am feeling.|      <*Answer_7029*>|"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,477,0)="\r\n  8. I care about what I am feeling.|      <*Answer_7030*>|\r\n  9. I am confused about how I feel.|      <*Answer_7031*>|\r\n  10. When I'm upset, I acknowledge my emotions.|      <*Answer_7032*>|\r\n  11. When I'm upset, I become angr"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,478,0)="y with myself for feeling that way.|      <*Answer_7033*>|\r\n  12. When I'm upset, I become embarrassed for feeling that way.|      <*Answer_7034*>|  13. When I'm upset, I have difficulty getting work done.|      <*Answer_7035*>|\r\n  14. "
^YTT(601.95,18,1,479,0)="When I'm upset, I become out of control.|      <*Answer_7036*>|\r\n  15. When I'm upset, I believe that I will remain that way for a long time.|      <*Answer_7037*>|\r\n  16. When I'm upset, I believe that I'll end up feeling very depresse"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,480,0)="d.|      <*Answer_7038*>|\r\n  17. When I'm upset, I believe that my feelings are valid and important.|      <*Answer_7039*>|\r\n  18. When I'm upset, I have difficulty focusing on other things.|      <*Answer_7040*>|\r\n  19. When I'm upse"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,481,0)="t, I feel out of control.|      <*Answer_7041*>|\r\n  20. When I'm upset, I can still get things done.|      <*Answer_7042*>|\r\n  21. When I'm upset, I feel ashamed with myself for feeling that way.|      <*Answer_7043*>|\r\n  22. When I'm"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,482,0)=" upset, I know that I can find a way to eventually feel better.|      <*Answer_7044*>|\r\n  23. When I'm upset, I feel like I am weak.|      <*Answer_7045*>|\r\n  24. When I'm upset, I feel like I can remain in control of my behaviors.|    "
^YTT(601.95,18,1,483,0)="  <*Answer_7046*>|\r\n  25. When I'm upset, I feel guilty for feeling that way.|      <*Answer_7047*>|\r\n  26. When I'm upset, I have difficulty concentrating.|      <*Answer_7048*>|\r\n  27. When I'm upset, I have difficulty controlling m"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,484,0)="y behaviors.|      <*Answer_7049*>|\r\n  28. When I'm upset, I believe there is nothing I can do to make myself feel better.|      <*Answer_7050*>|\r\n  29. When I'm upset, I become irritated with myself for feeling that way.|      <*Answer"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,485,0)="_7051*>|\r\n  30. When I'm upset, I start to feel very bad about myself.|      <*Answer_7052*>|\r\n  31. When I'm upset, I believe that wallowing in it is all I can do.|      <*Answer_7053*>|\r\n  32. When I'm upset, I lose control over my "
^YTT(601.95,18,1,486,0)="behaviors.|      <*Answer_7054*>|\r\n  33. When I'm upset, I have difficulty thinking about anything else.|      <*Answer_7055*>|\r\n  34. When I'm upset, I take time to figure out what I'm really feeling.|      <*Answer_7056*>|\r\n  35. Wh"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,487,0)="en I'm upset, it takes me a long time to feel better.|      <*Answer_7057*>|\r\n  36. When I'm upset, my emotions feel overwhelming.|      <*Answer_7058*>|  |  |\r\n  Information contained in this note is based on a self-report assessment a"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,488,0)="nd is not sufficient to use alone for diagnostic purposes.  Assessment results should be verified for accuracy and used in conjunction with other diagnostic activities.|\r\n    $~""},""scaleGroup"":[{""grid1"":0,""grid2"":0,""grid3"":0,""id"":232,""ins"
