^YTT(601.95,18,1,1824,0)="SD-5+I9 PTSD Screen: <*Answer_7776*>|   <*Answer_7771*>|<*Answer_7772*>|\r\n|   PC PTSD-5+I9 Suicide Screen: <*Answer_7777*>|   <*Answer_7773*>|<*Answer_7774*>| |\r\n \r\nQuestions and Answers|\r\n  \r\n    Sometimes things happen to people"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,1825,0)=" that are unusually or especially|  \r\n    frightening, horrible, or traumatic. For example:||\r\n       A serious accident or fire|\r\n       A physical or sexual assault or abuse|\r\n       An earthquake or flood|\r\n       A war|\r\n   "
^YTT(601.95,18,1,1826,0)="    Seeing someone be killed or seriously injured|\r\n       Having a loved one die through homicide or suicide||\r\n    Have you ever experienced this kind of event?|    <*Answer_7822*>||\r\n \r\n  1. Had nightmares about the event(s) when"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,1827,0)=" you did not want to?|     <*Answer_7823*>|\r\n   2. Tried hard not to think about the event(s) or went out of your way to|\r\n      avoid situations that remind you of the event(s)?|     <*Answer_7824*>|\r\n   3. Been constantly on guard, "
^YTT(601.95,18,1,1828,0)="watchful, or easily startled?|     <*Answer_7825*>|\r\n   4. Felt numb or detached from people, activities, or your surroundings?|     <*Answer_7826*>|\r\n   5. Felt guilty or unable to stop blaming yourself or others for the|\r\n      even"
^YTT(601.95,18,1,1829,0)="t(s) or any problems the event(s) may have caused?|     <*Answer_7828*>|\r\n   6. Over the last 2 weeks, how often have you been bothered by thoughts |\r\n      that you would be better off dead or of hurting yourself in some way?|     <*An"
