^YTT(601.95,19,1,2066,0)="""Adults"",""version"":""4\/2012"",""wasOperational"":true},""report"":{""id"":99,""instrument"":197,""template"":"".| .| Dysfunctional Beliefs and Attitudes About Sleep (DBAS-16)| | Date Given: <.Date_Given.>| Clinician: <.Staff_Ordered_By.>| Location: <.L"
^YTT(601.95,19,1,2067,0)="ocation.>| | Veteran: <.Patient_Name_Last_First.>| SSN: \r\n<.Patient_SSN.>| DOB: <.Patient_Date_Of_Birth.> (<.Patient_Age.>)| Gender: <.Patient_Gender.>| | | |\r\nDBAS-16 Total Score = <-TOTAL SCORE->|\r\n| Higher scores reflect greater dy"
^YTT(601.95,19,1,2068,0)="sfunctional beliefs about sleep. Target beliefs expressed in items with scores greater than 5.| |\r\nQuestions and Answers| |\r\n1. I need 8 hours of sleep to feel refreshed and function well during the day.|     <*Answer_6589*>|\r\n2. When"
^YTT(601.95,19,1,2069,0)=" I do not get the proper amount of sleep on a given night, I need to catch up on the next day by napping or on the next night by sleeping longer.|     <*Answer_6590*>|\r\n3. I am concerned that chronic insomnia may have serious consequences"
^YTT(601.95,19,1,2070,0)=" for my physical health.|     <*Answer_6591*>|\r\n4. I am worried that I may lose control over my abilities to sleep.|     <*Answer_6592*>|\r\n5. After a poor night's sleep, I know that it will interfere with my daily activities on the next"
^YTT(601.95,19,1,2071,0)=" day.|     <*Answer_6593*>|\r\n6. In order to be alert and function well during the day, I am better off taking a sleeping pill rather than having a poor night's sleep.|     <*Answer_6594*>|\r\n7. When I feel irritable, depressed, or anxiou"
^YTT(601.95,19,1,2072,0)="s during the day, it is mostly because I did not sleep well the night before.|     <*Answer_6595*>|\r\n8. When I sleep poorly on one night, I know that it will disturb my sleep schedule for the whole week.|     <*Answer_6596*>|\r\n9. Withou"
^YTT(601.95,19,1,2073,0)="t an adequate nights sleep, I can hardly function the next day.|     <*Answer_6597*>|"
^YTT(601.95,19,1,2074,0)="\r\n10. I can't ever predict whether I will have a good or poor night's sleep.|     <*Answer_6598*>|\r\n11. I have little ability to manage the negative consequences of disturbed sleep.|     <*Answer_6599*>|\r\n12. When I feel tired, have n"
^YTT(601.95,19,1,2075,0)="o energy, or just seem not to function well during the day, it is generally because I did not sleep well the night before.|     <*Answer_6600*>|\r\n13. I believe that insomnia is essentially the result of a chemical imbalance.|     <*Answer"
^YTT(601.95,19,1,2076,0)="_6601*>|\r\n14. I feel that insomnia is ruining my ability to enjoy life and prevents me from doing what I want.|     <*Answer_6602*>|\r\n15. Medication is probably the only solution to sleeplessness.|     <*Answer_6603*>|\r\n16. I avoid or"
^YTT(601.95,19,1,2077,0)=" cancel obligations (social, family, occupational) after a poor night's sleep.|     <*Answer_6604*>|\r\n| | Information contained in this note is based on a self-report assessment and is not sufficient to use alone for diagnostic purposes. "
^YTT(601.95,19,1,2078,0)=" Assessment results should be verified for accuracy and used in conjunction with\r\n other diagnostic activities.|  $~""},""scaleGroup"":[{""grid1"":null,""grid2"":null,""grid3"":null,""id"":301,""instrument"":197,""name"":""DBAS-16"",""ordInc"":1,""ordMax"":11"
