^YTT(601.95,36,1,506,0)="tional"":true},""report"":{""id"":181,""instrument"":258,""template"":""|.|.|Eating Attitudes Test-26 Item (EAT-26) |\r\n  |   Date Given: <.Date_Given.>|   Clinician: <.Staff_Ordered_By.>|   \r\nLocation:  <.Location.>|   |   Veteran:  <.Patient_Nam"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,507,0)="e_Last_First.>|   \r\nSSN: <.Patient_SSN.>|   DOB: <.Patient_Date_Of_Birth.> (<.Patient_Age.>)\r\n|   Gender: <.Patient_Gender.>| |\r\n \r\nEAT-26 Total Score = <-TOTAL SCORE-> | |\r\n \r\nBMI = <*Answer_7772*>| |\r\n \r\nBehavioral alerts "
^YTT(601.95,36,1,508,0)="present = <*Answer_7773*>| |\r\n \r\nA score at or above 20 on the EAT-26 indicates a high level of concern | \r\nabout dieting, body weight or problematic eating behaviors.| |\r\n \r\nQuestions and Answers:| |\r\n \r\nPart B:||\r\n \r\n  1"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,509,0)=".  Am terrified about being overweight.|       <*Answer_8420*>| |\r\n   2.  Avoid eating when I am hungry.|       <*Answer_8421*>| |\r\n   3.  Find myself preoccupied with food.|       <*Answer_8422*>| |\r\n   4.  Have gone on eating binges"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,510,0)=" where I feel that I may not be able to stop.|       <*Answer_8423*>| |\r\n   5.  Cut my food into small pieces.|       <*Answer_8424*>| |"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,511,0)="\r\n   6.  Aware of the calorie content of food that I eat.|       <*Answer_8425*>| |\r\n   7.  Particularly avoid food with a high carbohydrate content (i.e., bread, rice, potatoes, etc.).|       <*Answer_8426*>| |\r\n   8.  Feel that othe"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,512,0)="r would prefer if I ate more.|       <*Answer_8427*>| |\r\n   9.  Vomit after I have eaten.|       <*Answer_8428*>| |\r\n   10. Feel extremely guilty after eating.|       <*Answer_8429*>| |\r\n   11. Am preoccupied with a desire to be thinn"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,513,0)="er.|       <*Answer_8430*>| |\r\n   12. Think about burning up calories when I exercise.|       <*Answer_8431*>| |\r\n   13. Other people think that I am too thin.|       <*Answer_8432*>| |\r\n   14. Am preoccupied with the thought of havin"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,514,0)="g fat on my body.|       <*Answer_8433*>| |\r\n   15. Take longer than others to eat my meals.|       <*Answer_8434*>| |\r\n   16. Avoid foods with sugar in them.|       <*Answer_8435*>| |\r\n   17. Eat diet foods.|       <*Answer_8436*>| |"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,515,0)="\r\n   18. Feel that food controls my life.|       <*Answer_8437*>| |\r\n   19. Display self-control around food.|       <*Answer_8438*>| |\r\n   20. Feel that others pressure me to eat.|       <*Answer_8439*>| |\r\n   21. Give too much tim"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,516,0)="e and thought to food.|       <*Answer_8440*>| |\r\n   22. Feel uncomfortable after eating sweets.|       <*Answer_8441*>| |\r\n   23. Engage in dieting behavior.|       <*Answer_8442*>| |\r\n   24. Like my stomach to be empty.|       <*Ans"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,517,0)="wer_8443*>| |\r\n   25. Have the impulse to vomit after meals.|       <*Answer_8444*>| |\r\n   26. Enjoy trying new rich foods.|       <*Answer_8445*>| |\r\n   \r\n \r\nPart C:||\r\n \r\n  A. Gone on eating binges where you feel that you ma"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,518,0)="y not be able to stop?|      <*Answer_8446*>| |\r\n   B. Ever made yourself sick (vomited) to control your weight or shape?|      <*Answer_8447*>| |\r\n   C. Ever used laxatives, diet pills or diuretics (water pills) to control your weight "
^YTT(601.95,36,1,519,0)="or shape?|      <*Answer_8448*>| |\r\n   D. Exercised more than 60 minutes a day to lose or to control your weight?|      <*Answer_8449*>| |\r\n   E. Lost 20 pounds or more in the past 6 months?|      <*Answer_8450*>| |\r\n \r\nInformation "
^YTT(601.95,36,1,520,0)="contained in this note is based on a self-report assessment and is not sufficient to \r\nuse alone for diagnostic purposes. Assessment results should be verified\r\n for accuracy and used in conjunction with other diagnostic activities.| |\"
