^YTT(601.95,36,1,640,0)="emplate"":""|.|.|Composite Morningness Questionnaire (CMQ) |\r\n  |   Date Given: <.Date_Given.>|   Clinician: <.Staff_Ordered_By.>|   \r\nLocation:  <.Location.>|   |   Veteran:  <.Patient_Name_Last_First.>|   \r\nSSN: <.Patient_SSN.>|   DOB"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,641,0)=": <.Patient_Date_Of_Birth.> (<.Patient_Age.>)\r\n|   Gender: <.Patient_Gender.>| |\r\n \r\nCMQ Total Score = <-CMQ Total Score->| |\r\n \r\nA score of 22 or below indicates an evening type, a score above 44 indicates |\r\n a morning type, a"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,642,0)="nd scores in between receive a classification of|\r\n intermediate.| |\r\n \r\nQuestions and Answers:| |\r\n \r\n1. Considering only your own \""feeling best\"" rhythm, at what time would you get|\r\n    up if you were entirely free to plan y"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,643,0)="our day?|\r\n    <*Answer_8470*>||\r\n 2. Considering your only \""feeling best\"" rhythm, at what time would you go to|\r\n    bed if you were entirely free to plan your evening?|\r\n    <*Answer_8471*>||\r\n 3. Assuming normal circumstance,"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,644,0)=" how easy do you find getting up in the |\r\n    morning?|\r\n    <*Answer_8472*>||\r\n 4. How alert do you feel during the first half hour after having awakened|\r\n    in the morning?|\r\n    <*Answer_8473*>||\r\n 5. During the first half"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,645,0)=" hour after having awakened in the morning, how |\r\n    tired to you feel?|\r\n    <*Answer_8474*>||\r\n 6. You have decided to engage in some physical exercise.  A friend suggests|\r\n    that you do this one hour twice a week and the bes"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,646,0)="t time for him is |\r\n    7:00-8:00 a.m.  Bearing in mind nothing else but your own \""feeling best\""|\r\n    rhythm, how do you think you would perform?|"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,647,0)="\r\n    <*Answer_8475*>||\r\n 7. At what time in the evening do you feel tired and, as a result, in |\r\n    need of sleep?|\r\n    <*Answer_8476*>||\r\n 8. You wish to be at your peak performance for a test which you know is |\r\n    going"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,648,0)=" to be mentally exhausting and lasting for two hours. You are|\r\n    entirely free to plan your day, and considering only your own \""feeling|\r\n    best\"" rhythm, which ONE of the four testing times would you choose?|\r\n    <*Answer_8477"
^YTT(601.95,36,1,649,0)="*>||\r\n 9. One hears about \""morning\"" and \""evening\"" types of people.  Which ONE |\r\n    of these types do you consider yourself to be?|\r\n    <*Answer_8478*>||\r\n10. When would you prefer to rise (provided you have a full day's work-"
