^YTT(601.95,36,1,1047,0)="al"":true},""report"":{""id"":186,""instrument"":263,""template"":""|.|.|Nursing Delirium Screening Scale - (NUDESC) |\r\n  |   Date Given: <.Date_Given.>|   Clinician: <.Staff_Ordered_By.>|\r\n   Location:  <.Location.>|   |   Veteran:  <.Patient_Na"
