^YTT(601.95,42,1,98,0)="al Beliefs and Attitudes About Sleep (DBAS-16)| | Date Given: <.Date_Given.>| Clinician: <.Staff_Ordered_By.>| Location: <.Location.>| | Veteran: <.Patient_Name_Last_First.>| SSN: \r\n<.Patient_SSN.>| DOB: <.Patient_Date_Of_Birth.> (<.Patie"
^YTT(601.95,42,1,99,0)="nt_Age.>)| Gender: <.Patient_Gender.>| | | |\r\nDBAS-16 Total Score = <-TOTAL SCORE->|\r\n| Higher scores reflect greater dysfunctional beliefs about sleep. Target beliefs expressed in items with scores greater than 5.| |\r\nQuestions and A"
^YTT(601.95,42,1,100,0)="nswers| |\r\n1. I need 8 hours of sleep to feel refreshed and function well during the day.|     <*Answer_6589*>|\r\n2. When I do not get the proper amount of sleep on a given night, I need to catch up on the next day by napping or on the n"
^YTT(601.95,42,1,101,0)="ext night by sleeping longer.|     <*Answer_6590*>|\r\n3. I am concerned that chronic insomnia may have serious consequences for my physical health.|     <*Answer_6591*>|\r\n4. I am worried that I may lose control over my abilities to sleep"
^YTT(601.95,42,1,102,0)=".|     <*Answer_6592*>|\r\n5. After a poor night's sleep, I know that it will interfere with my daily activities on the next day.|     <*Answer_6593*>|"
^YTT(601.95,42,1,103,0)="\r\n6. In order to be alert and function well during the day, I am better off taking a sleeping pill rather than having a poor night's sleep.|     <*Answer_6594*>|\r\n7. When I feel irritable, depressed, or anxious during the day, it is mos"
^YTT(601.95,42,1,104,0)="tly because I did not sleep well the night before.|     <*Answer_6595*>|\r\n8. When I sleep poorly on one night, I know that it will disturb my sleep schedule for the whole week.|     <*Answer_6596*>|\r\n9. Without an adequate night's sleep"
^YTT(601.95,42,1,105,0)=", I can hardly function the next day.|     <*Answer_6597*>|\r\n10. I can't ever predict whether I will have a good or poor night's sleep.|     <*Answer_6598*>|\r\n11. I have little ability to manage the negative consequences of disturbed sl"
^YTT(601.95,42,1,106,0)="eep.|     <*Answer_6599*>|\r\n12. When I feel tired, have no energy, or just seem not to function well during the day, it is generally because I did not sleep well the night before.|     <*Answer_6600*>|\r\n13. I believe that insomnia is es"
^YTT(601.95,42,1,107,0)="sentially the result of a chemical imbalance.|     <*Answer_6601*>|\r\n14. I feel that insomnia is ruining my ability to enjoy life and prevents me from doing what I want.|     <*Answer_6602*>|\r\n15. Medication is probably the only solutio"
^YTT(601.95,42,1,108,0)="n to sleeplessness.|     <*Answer_6603*>|\r\n16. I avoid or cancel obligations (social, family, occupational) after a poor night's sleep.|     <*Answer_6604*>|\r\n| | Information contained in this note is based on a self-report assessment a"
^YTT(601.95,42,1,109,0)="nd is not sufficient to use alone for diagnostic purposes.  Assessment results should be verified for accuracy and used in conjunction with\r\n other diagnostic activities.|  $~""},""scaleGroup"":[{""grid1"":null,""grid2"":null,""grid3"":null,""id"":3"
