^YTT(601.95,69,1,47,0)="38,""template"":""|Ascertain Dementia 8-item Informant Questionnaire (AD8)|\r\n|    Date Given: <.Date_Given.>\r\n|    Clinician: <.Staff_Ordered_By.>   \r\n|    Location:  <.Location.>|  \r\n|    Veteran:  <.Patient_Name_Last_First.>   \r\n| "
