^YTT(601.95,89,1,80,0)="8,""template"":""|Suicide-Related Coping Scale (SRCS)\r\n|  \r\n|   Date Given: <.Date_Given.>\r\n|   Clinician: <.Staff_Ordered_By.>\r\n|   Location:  <.Location.>\r\n|  \r\n|   Veteran:  <.Patient_Name_Last_First.>\r\n|   SSN: <.Patient_SSN."
^YTT(601.95,89,1,81,0)=">\r\n|   DOB: <.Patient_Date_Of_Birth.> (<.Patient_Age.>)\r\n|   Gender: <.Patient_Gender.>\r\n|  \r\n|   SRCS Total Score = <-SRCS Total->\r\n|    Internal Coping = <-External Coping->\r\n|    External Coping = <-Internal Coping->\r\n|  \r"
^YTT(601.95,89,1,82,0)="\n|  \r\n|Questions and Answers:\r\n|  \r\n|   1.  I have contact information for at least one health care professional\r\n|       (such as doctor or therapist) whom I can call during a suicidal \r\n|       crisis.\r\n|       <*Answer_8614*"
^YTT(601.95,89,1,83,0)=">\r\n|   2.  I cannot do anything to control my suicidal thoughts.\r\n|       <*Answer_8615*>\r\n|   3.  I know which friends and\/or family members to contact to help take\r\n|       my mind off my suicidal feelings.\r\n|       <*Answer_86"
^YTT(601.95,89,1,84,0)="16*>\r\n|   4.  I know the nearest hospital or urgent care facility where I can go\r\n|       if I cannot handle my suicidal feelings.\r\n|       <*Answer_8617*>\r\n|   5.  When I feel suicidal, there are places I can go (such as a coffee\r"
^YTT(601.95,89,1,85,0)="\n|       shop, the gym, place of worship, or shopping mall) to help me take\r\n|       my mind off my problems.\r\n|       <*Answer_8618*>"
^YTT(601.95,89,1,86,0)="\r\n|   6.  I have several things I can do to get through a suicidal crisis.\r\n|       <*Answer_8619*>\r\n|   7.  I am able to confide in someone, such as a friend, family member,\r\n|       supervisor, or spiritual advisor when I am exper"
^YTT(601.95,89,1,87,0)="iencing a crisis.\r\n|       <*Answer_8620*>\r\n|   8.  Seeking help from health care professionals is a good way to keep\r\n|       myself safe when I am feeling suicidal.\r\n|       <*Answer_8621*>\r\n|   9.  I know it is important to lim"
^YTT(601.95,89,1,88,0)="it access to weapons or other ways to\r\n|       hurt myself when I am feeling suicidal.\r\n|       <*Answer_8622*>\r\n|  10.  Even if I am alone, there are things I can do to take mind off my\r\n|       suicidal feelings and thoughts for a"
^YTT(601.95,89,1,89,0)="t least a while.\r\n|       <*Answer_8623*>\r\n|  11.  I do not think there is anything that I can do to help myself when\r\n|       I am feeling suicidal.\r\n|       <*Answer_8624*>\r\n|  12.  It is useless to talk to anyone about my suici"
^YTT(601.95,89,1,90,0)="dal thoughts.\r\n|       <*Answer_8625*>\r\n|  13.  When I am suicidal, I know of things to do by myself that help me\r\n|       feel less suicidal.\r\n|       <*Answer_8626*>\r\n|  14.  I can distract myself by doing other things or thinki"
^YTT(601.95,89,1,91,0)="ng about other\r\n|       things when I am feeling suicidal.\r\n|       <*Answer_8627*>\r\n|  15.  If one way of trying to cope with suicidal feelings does not work,\r\n|       I have other ways to try.\r\n|       <*Answer_8628*>\r\n|  16. "
^YTT(601.95,89,1,92,0)=" I am at the mercy of my suicidal thoughts.\r\n|       <*Answer_8629*>\r\n|  17.  I feel that I have no one to turn to when I am feeling suicidal.\r\n|       <*Answer_8630*>\r\n|  \r\n|Information contained in this note is based on a self-r"
^YTT(601.95,89,1,93,0)="eport assessment \r\n|and is not sufficient to use alone for diagnostic purposes. Assessment \r\n|results should be verified for accuracy and used in conjunction with \r\n|other diagnostic activities.""},""scaleGroup"":[{""grid1"":0,""grid2"":0,""g"
