^YTT(601.95,172,1,7670,0)="                           <-Support->|   Pain Severity                     \r\n <-Pain Severity->|   Life-Con\r\ntrol                       <-Life-Control->|   Affective Distress                 <-Affective Distress->||Part II|   Negative "
