^YTT(601.95,291,1,232,0)="r\n|  \r\nSUBSCALE SCORES: |\r\n   Non-acceptance of emotional responses(NONACCEPT) = <-NONACCEPT->|\r\n   Difficulties engaging in goal-directed behavior(GOALS) = <-GOALS->|\r\n   Impulse control difficulties(IMPULSE) = <-IMPULSE->|\r\n   "
^YTT(601.95,291,1,233,0)="Limited access to emotion regulation strategies(STRATEGIES) = <-STRATEGIES->|\r\n   Lack of emotional awareness (AWARENESS) = <-AWARENESS->|\r\n   Lack of emotional clarity(CLARITY) = <-CLARITY->|\r\n|  \r\nHigher scores suggest greater pro"
^YTT(601.95,291,1,234,0)="blems with emotion regulation.\r\n|\r\n|\r\nQuestions and Answers|\r\n  1. I am clear about my feelings.|      <*Answer_7023*>|\r\n  2. I pay attention to how I feel.|      <*Answer_7024*>|\r\n  3. I experience my emotions as overwhelming a"
^YTT(601.95,291,1,235,0)="nd out of control.|      <*Answer_7025*>|\r\n  4. I have no idea how I am feeling.|      <*Answer_7026*>|\r\n  5. I have difficulty making sense out of my feelings.|      <*Answer_7027*>|\r\n  6. I am attentive to my feelings.|      <*Answe"
^YTT(601.95,291,1,236,0)="r_7028*>|\r\n  7. I know exactly how I am feeling.|      <*Answer_7029*>|\r\n  8. I care about what I am feeling.|      <*Answer_7030*>|\r\n  9. I am confused about how I feel.|      <*Answer_7031*>|\r\n  10. When I'm upset, I acknowledge m"
^YTT(601.95,291,1,237,0)="y emotions.|      <*Answer_7032*>|\r\n  11. When I'm upset, I become angry with myself for feeling that way.|      <*Answer_7033*>|\r\n  12. When I'm upset, I become embarrassed for feeling that way.|      <*Answer_7034*>|  13. When I'm ups"
^YTT(601.95,291,1,238,0)="et, I have difficulty getting work done.|      <*Answer_7035*>|\r\n  14. When I'm upset, I become out of control.|      <*Answer_7036*>|"
^YTT(601.95,291,1,239,0)="\r\n  15. When I'm upset, I believe that I will remain that way for a long time.|      <*Answer_7037*>|\r\n  16. When I'm upset, I believe that I'll end up feeling very depressed.|      <*Answer_7038*>|\r\n  17. When I'm upset, I believe th"
^YTT(601.95,291,1,240,0)="at my feelings are valid and important.|      <*Answer_7039*>|\r\n  18. When I'm upset, I have difficulty focusing on other things.|      <*Answer_7040*>|\r\n  19. When I'm upset, I feel out of control.|      <*Answer_7041*>|\r\n  20. When "
^YTT(601.95,291,1,241,0)="I'm upset, I can still get things done.|      <*Answer_7042*>|\r\n  21. When I'm upset, I feel ashamed with myself for feeling that way.|      <*Answer_7043*>|\r\n  22. When I'm upset, I know that I can find a way to eventually feel better."
^YTT(601.95,291,1,242,0)="|      <*Answer_7044*>|\r\n  23. When I'm upset, I feel like I am weak.|      <*Answer_7045*>|\r\n  24. When I'm upset, I feel like I can remain in control of my behaviors.|      <*Answer_7046*>|\r\n  25. When I'm upset, I feel guilty for f"
^YTT(601.95,291,1,243,0)="eeling that way.|      <*Answer_7047*>|\r\n  26. When I'm upset, I have difficulty concentrating.|      <*Answer_7048*>|\r\n  27. When I'm upset, I have difficulty controlling my behaviors.|      <*Answer_7049*>|\r\n  28. When I'm upset, I "
^YTT(601.95,291,1,244,0)="believe there is nothing I can do to make myself feel better.|      <*Answer_7050*>|\r\n  29. When I'm upset, I become irritated with myself for feeling that way.|      <*Answer_7051*>|\r\n  30. When I'm upset, I start to feel very bad abou"
^YTT(601.95,291,1,245,0)="t myself.|      <*Answer_7052*>|\r\n  31. When I'm upset, I believe that wallowing in it is all I can do.|      <*Answer_7053*>|\r\n  32. When I'm upset, I lose control over my behaviors.|      <*Answer_7054*>|\r\n  33. When I'm upset, I ha"
^YTT(601.95,291,1,246,0)="ve difficulty thinking about anything else.|      <*Answer_7055*>|\r\n  34. When I'm upset, I take time to figure out what I'm really feeling.|      <*Answer_7056*>|\r\n  35. When I'm upset, it takes me a long time to feel better.|      <*A"
^YTT(601.95,291,1,247,0)="nswer_7057*>|\r\n  36. When I'm upset, my emotions feel overwhelming.|      <*Answer_7058*>|  |  |\r\n  Information contained in this note is based on a self-report assessment and is not sufficient to use alone for diagnostic purposes.  Ass"
