^YTT(601.95,357,1,121,0)="\r\n|  \r\n|<*Answer_7771*>\r\n|  \r\n|  \r\n|Questions and Answers:\r\n|  \r\n|   1.  This questionnaire asks about experiences you may have had after a\r\n|very stressful experience.  Please indicate whether you had at least one \r\n|expe"
^YTT(601.95,357,1,122,0)="rience as described below that is currently distressing \r\n|(select all that apply).\r\n|\r\n|<*Answer_7772*>\r\n|\r\n| MIOS\r\n|   2.  I blame myself.\r\n|       <*Answer_9284*>\r\n|   3.  I have lost faith in humanity.\r\n|       <*Answe"
^YTT(601.95,357,1,123,0)="r_9285*>\r\n|   4.  People would hate me if they really knew me.\r\n|       <*Answer_9286*>\r\n|   5.  I have trouble seeing goodness in others.\r\n|       <*Answer_9287*>\r\n|   6.  People don't deserve second chances.\r\n|       <*Answer_"
^YTT(601.95,357,1,124,0)="9288*>\r\n|   7.  I am disgusted by what happened.\r\n|       <*Answer_9289*>\r\n|   8.  I feel like I don't deserve a good life.\r\n|       <*Answer_9290*>\r\n|   9.  I keep myself from having success.\r\n|       <*Answer_9291*>\r\n|  10. "
