^YTT(601.95,429,1,65,0)="<-CDSS->\r\n|\r\n|   A score higher than 6 has an 82% specificity and 85% sensitivity\r\n|   for predicting the presence of a major depressive episode.  \r\n|  \r\n|Questions and Answers:\r\n|  \r\n|   I.  DEPRESSION: How would you describe"
^YTT(601.95,429,1,66,0)=" your mood over the last two \r\n|       weeks? Do you remain reasonably cheerful or have you been very \r\n|       depressed or low-spirited recently? In the last two weeks, how \r\n|       often have you (own words) every day?  All day?\r"
^YTT(601.95,429,1,67,0)="\n|       <*Answer_9257*>\r\n|  II.  HOPELESSNESS: How do you see the future for yourself? Can you "
^YTT(601.95,429,1,68,0)="\r\n|       see any future? Or has life seemed quite hopeless? Have you \r\n|       given up or does there still seem some reason for trying?\r\n|       <*Answer_9258*>\r\n|  III.  SELF-DEPRECIATION: What is your opinion of yourself compare"
^YTT(601.95,429,1,69,0)="d\r\n|        to other people? Do you feel better, not as good, or about the \r\n|        same as others? Do you feel inferior or even worthless?\r\n|        <*Answer_9259*>\r\n|  IV.  GUILTY IDEAS OF REFERENCE: Do you have the feeling that"
^YTT(601.95,429,1,70,0)=" you are \r\n|       being blamed for something or even wrongly accused? What about? \r\n|       (Do not include justifiable blame or accusation. Exclude delusions \r\n|       of guilt.) \r\n|       <*Answer_9260*>\r\n|   V.  PATHOLOGICAL G"
^YTT(601.95,429,1,71,0)="UILT: Do you tend to blame yourself for little \r\n|       things you may have done in the past? Do you think that you \r\n|       deserve to be so concerned about this?\r\n|       <*Answer_9261*>\r\n|  VI.  MORNING DEPRESSION: When you hav"
^YTT(601.95,429,1,72,0)="e felt depressed over the last \r\n|       two weeks, have you noticed the depression being worse at any \r\n|       particular time of day?\r\n|       <*Answer_9262*>\r\n|  VII.  EARLY WAKENING: Do you wake earlier in the morning than is n"
^YTT(601.95,429,1,73,0)="ormal \r\n|        for you? How many times a week does this happen?\r\n|        <*Answer_9263*>\r\n|  VIII.  SUICIDE: Have you felt that life wasn't worth living? Did you \r\n|         ever feel like ending it all? What did you think you mi"
^YTT(601.95,429,1,74,0)="ght do? \r\n|         Did you actually try?\r\n|         <*Answer_9264*>\r\n|  IX.  OBSERVED DEPRESSION: Based on interviewer's observations during \r\n|       the entire interview. The question \""Do you feel like crying?\"", \r\n|       use"
^YTT(601.95,429,1,75,0)="d at appropriate points in the interview, may elicit information\r\n|       useful to this observation.\r\n|       <*Answer_9265*>\r\n|  \r\n|Information contained in this note is based on a self-report assessment \r\n|and is not sufficient"
^YTT(601.95,429,1,76,0)=" to use alone for diagnostic purposes. Assessment \r\n|results should be verified for accuracy and used in conjunction with \r\n|other diagnostic activities.""},""scaleGroup"":[{""grid1"":0,""grid2"":0,""grid3"":0,""id"":399,""instrument"":330,""name"":""C"
