^YTT(601.95,434,1,266,0)=" 0-24):\r\n\r\n   A high score on the subscales Use (above 0) and Risk Factors (above 11) calls for further examination. \r\n   A score below 13 on Protective Factors is clinically significant."",""lastEditDate"":3230817.1815,""lastEditedBy"":""S"
