^YTT(601.95,465,1,194,0)="hape?\r\n|        <*Answer_8731*>\r\n|  27  How uncomfortable have you felt seeing your body (for example, \r\n|      seeing your shape in the mirror, in a shop window reflection, \r\n|      while undressing or taking a bath or shower)?\r\n"
