^YTT(601.95,553,1,16,0)="ccasionally during day but for very short distances, with or without assistance. Spends most of each shift in bed or chair. WALKS FREQUENTLY: Walks outside room at least twice a  \r\nday and inside room at least once every 2 hours during wa"
