^YTT(601.95,664,1,70,0)="TAL DEPRESSION->| |\r\n<*Answer_7771*>|\r\n<*Answer_7772*>| |\r\nTotal scores range from a minimum of 0 to a maximum of 30. Mothers who score above 10 are likely to be suffering from a depressive illness of varying severity. A careful clini"
^YTT(601.95,664,1,71,0)="cal assessment should be carried out to \r\nconfirm the diagnosis. The scale indicates how the mother has felt during the previous week.\r\n \r\n||Questions and Answers\r\n|1.  I have been able to laugh and see the funny side of things|\r\n"
^YTT(601.95,664,1,72,0)="<*Answer_7934*>\r\n|2.  I have looked forward with enjoyment to things|\r\n<*Answer_7935*>\r\n|3.  I have blamed myself unnecessarily when things went wrong|\r\n<*Answer_7936*>\r\n|4.  I have been anxious or worried for no good reason|\r\n<"
^YTT(601.95,664,1,73,0)="*Answer_7937*>\r\n|5.  I have felt scared or panicky for no very good reason|\r\n<*Answer_7938*>\r\n|6.  Things have been getting on top of me|\r\n<*Answer_7939*>\r\n|7.  I have been so unhappy that I have had difficulty sleeping|\r\n<*Answ"
^YTT(601.95,664,1,74,0)="er_7940*>\r\n|8.  I have felt sad or miserable|\r\n<*Answer_7941*>\r\n|9.  I have been so unhappy that I have been crying|\r\n<*Answer_7942*>\r\n|10. The thought of harming myself has occurred to me |\r\n<*Answer_7943*>| |\r\n \r\n \r\nInfo"
